/*
  StembotixOTA example - Blockzie App Realtime
  --------------------------------------------
  Blockzie realtime (WiFi) firmware with OTA updates.

  - Normal mode: joins WiFi and runs the Blockzie HTTP server, so the
    Blockzie app can control the board live (/connect, /disconnect, /control).
  - Hold BOOT 3 s -> OTA mode: Blockzie server stops, the board waits for
    new firmware from https://ota.blockzieai.com/dashboard
  - Hold BOOT 3 s again in OTA mode -> WiFi setup hotspot STEMbotix-Setup-XXXX.
    The WiFi saved there is used by both Blockzie and OTA.

  Set DEFAULT_SSID / DEFAULT_PASS below, or leave them and use the setup hotspot.

  Extra libraries needed (Library Manager):
    ESP32Servo, DHT sensor library, TM1637 (TM1637Display), Adafruit TCS34725,
    Adafruit NeoPixel, LiquidCrystal I2C, Adafruit GFX, Adafruit SSD1306
*/
